        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ganphiu ganchuang kanloumeipu,",
            "Kandih lung rianra rianriu mei guai;",
            "Panti muang jingbang nai dat lak khe,",
            "Kapma tammei nai dat lak khe.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Lily munpuang le tik dailiangmei ram,",
            "Laujiu Nah le kanloumei bam pui ram;",
            "Tingkau chang khak le thanhmei nun",
            "Hou khang ai ninge.",
            "",
            "2. Phang jao o tik dailiangmei ram tangmei nunrui,",
            "Thuanpui khuan gaimei lu 9!@ suanna;",
            "Kandih champan thiu rui kao sini,",
            "Njianna ai guang dat lak khe.",
            "",
            "3. Kanloumei nunrui Jerusalem than gaimei khou,",
            "Neilana bamme ramgai khou 9!@;",
            "Ai bamni e kaniu ram gai khou,",
            "Alung khou hei ningtan mak ge.",
            "",
            "4. Lung neila duidai pang poubaumei bampui ram,",
            "Neih le buh le ganchuanga ni mak",
            "Lung rianra mei hei nai dat lak khe,",
            "Laujiu Nah rui gan gai lou e."
          ]
        }
      },
